WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.330
For our store entity, the properties

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:03.810
might include the region it belongs

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.970
to, its square footage, or its

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:07.610
priority classification for the supply

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.190
chain. And then we have to

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:10.630
connect them. That brings us to

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.870
relationships. Relationships define

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.110
the verbs between the nouns.

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.990
They explain how different entity types

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.330
interact in the real world.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:19.230
Give me an example.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.170
You might define a relationship that

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:24.110
states a store operates a refrigeration

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:27.010
unit or a supplier ships a

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:29.510
product. You are drawing explicit lines

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:31.010
of meaning so the AI doesn't

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:32.210
have to guess how a supplier

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:33.230
and a store are connected.
